# Shell scripts and Dockerfiles run inside Linux containers — a CRLF
# checkout (common on Windows without this file) corrupts their shebang
# line and makes `exec ./script.sh` fail with a confusing "not found"
# inside the container. Force LF regardless of platform/autocrlf settings.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
